1
00:00:13,763 --> 00:00:16,433
[Anzu] Come on, Hijiri,
I already told you.

2
00:00:17,016 --> 00:00:18,935
Don't bother asking me out.

3
00:00:19,978 --> 00:00:22,939
But Tsuchiya said,
that meant I should ask you out.

4
00:00:23,023 --> 00:00:24,190
Tsuchiya!

5
00:00:24,274 --> 00:00:25,942
Sincerest apologies.

6
00:00:26,651 --> 00:00:28,945
[Hijiri] I looked into
some places normal folk enjoy.

7
00:00:29,738 --> 00:00:32,198
I'd appreciate it
if you'd show some gratitude

8
00:00:32,282 --> 00:00:34,159
that you are able to date me.

9
00:00:34,242 --> 00:00:35,952
[mimics choking]

10
00:00:36,745 --> 00:00:38,413
[sighs]
I'm not a realistic

11
00:00:38,496 --> 00:00:40,915
potential romantic partner for you, am I?

12
00:00:40,999 --> 00:00:42,459
What are you saying?

13
00:00:42,542 --> 00:00:44,919
I'll have you know,
every woman in the world sees me

14
00:00:45,003 --> 00:00:47,464
as a potential romantic partner for them.

15
00:00:48,047 --> 00:00:50,508
All right. I'm about to beat you at drums.

16
00:00:50,592 --> 00:00:52,343
No whining if I hit you by accident.

17
00:00:52,427 --> 00:00:54,471
Sorry, that one's not interesting.

18
00:00:56,181 --> 00:00:57,974
Why don't we play this one over here?

19
00:00:59,142 --> 00:00:59,976
Oh.

20
00:01:00,810 --> 00:01:03,480
That plushie toy I wanted
last time is still there.

21
00:01:04,064 --> 00:01:06,649
Rio took all of our prizes home
that night.

22
00:01:06,733 --> 00:01:08,234
-What?
-Hmm?

23
00:01:08,318 --> 00:01:09,903
I'd still plan a better date.

24
00:01:09,986 --> 00:01:12,280
There's no way
you know her as well as I do.

25
00:01:13,073 --> 00:01:14,908
Your disrespectful cousin.

26
00:01:15,867 --> 00:01:18,745
-All right, I'll buy everything in there.
-[snaps fingers]

27
00:01:18,828 --> 00:01:21,039
Will my paycheck cover it, Tsuchiya?

28
00:01:21,122 --> 00:01:22,749
Allow me to check with the manager.

29
00:01:22,832 --> 00:01:24,793
[Anzu] Just play the game, please!

30
00:01:24,876 --> 00:01:28,004
Why bother with that part of it?
I really don't understand.

31
00:01:28,088 --> 00:01:28,922
[Anzu] Hmm.

32
00:01:29,005 --> 00:01:31,090
Hey, I know. Let's hit the photo booth.

33
00:01:31,591 --> 00:01:34,177
-Whoa!
-Mr. Tsuchiya, come on!

34
00:01:34,260 --> 00:01:35,428
You want me in it?

35
00:01:35,512 --> 00:01:36,429
[Anzu] Yup.

36
00:01:37,388 --> 00:01:39,390
[cheerful music]

37
00:01:41,976 --> 00:01:43,561
[Anzu] Hurry, Mr. Tsuchiya!

38
00:01:44,062 --> 00:01:44,938
[Tsuchiya] Yes, miss.

39
00:01:50,193 --> 00:01:52,070
-[Tsuchiya grunts]
-[automated voice] Give me a hot pose!

40
00:01:52,153 --> 00:01:53,738
-Oh. Right there, the camera.
-Hmm.

41
00:01:53,822 --> 00:01:56,616
-[automated voice] Three, two, one.
-[exclaims]

42
00:01:56,699 --> 00:01:57,784
[camera clicks]

43
00:01:58,451 --> 00:01:59,285
SP TRIO

44
00:01:59,369 --> 00:02:01,704
[Anzu] Somehow we do always end up
having fun together.

45
00:02:03,623 --> 00:02:05,917
-[Yukana] Miss Anzu Hoshino.
-Hmm?

46
00:02:07,335 --> 00:02:08,795
Nice to meet you.

47
00:02:09,462 --> 00:02:11,506
How are you? My name's Yukana Kishi.

48
00:02:12,423 --> 00:02:15,802
Tsukasa, he lives with you
at your place, isn't that right?

49
00:02:17,053 --> 00:02:18,513
Um…

50
00:02:20,098 --> 00:02:21,307
We've been together,

51
00:02:22,350 --> 00:02:25,436
for, well, I'd say for quite a while now.

52
00:02:25,520 --> 00:02:27,230
[insects chirruping]

53
00:02:32,026 --> 00:02:34,028
[theme music]

54
00:03:58,154 --> 00:04:01,199
#11 JUST TELL ME IF YOU DON'T LIKE IT

55
00:04:01,282 --> 00:04:02,367
Mr. Hijiri.

56
00:04:02,450 --> 00:04:03,451
[Hijiri] What is it?

57
00:04:03,534 --> 00:04:07,121
Well, I thought I was seeing things,
so I kept quiet at first.

58
00:04:07,956 --> 00:04:10,917
But I could sense someone's eye
on us all day today.

59
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:12,043
[gasps]

60
00:04:12,126 --> 00:04:14,504
[Tsuchiya] We parted ways
with Miss Hoshino at the station,

61
00:04:14,587 --> 00:04:16,256
but I must say I'm concerned.

62
00:04:19,259 --> 00:04:20,718
I can check up on her.

63
00:04:22,011 --> 00:04:24,472
[Anzu] So you're Kazuki's, uh, girlfriend?

64
00:04:24,555 --> 00:04:25,723
Yes, I am.

65
00:04:25,807 --> 00:04:28,643
But everybody who's close to us is
against it for some reason,

66
00:04:28,726 --> 00:04:30,853
so I'm never allowed to see him anymore.

67
00:04:31,562 --> 00:04:33,022
[Yukana] It's terrible, isn't it?

68
00:04:33,523 --> 00:04:35,858
Tearing lovers apart that way?

69
00:04:35,942 --> 00:04:37,110
[Anzu] I don't know.

70
00:04:37,193 --> 00:04:40,238
I just don't see Kazuki
being with someone like her.

71
00:04:40,822 --> 00:04:43,366
[Yukana] His sister
is truly an evil person,

72
00:04:43,449 --> 00:04:46,244
the complete opposite of my sweet Tsukasa.

73
00:04:46,327 --> 00:04:47,870
[Anzu] I just don't know.

74
00:04:48,830 --> 00:04:50,123
Something feels off.

75
00:04:50,206 --> 00:04:52,208
[foreboding music]

76
00:04:58,798 --> 00:04:59,841
[uneasy sigh]

77
00:05:02,427 --> 00:05:04,137
I've been searching frantically

78
00:05:04,220 --> 00:05:05,972
because no one would tell me
where he moved.

79
00:05:06,931 --> 00:05:09,017
And I found him thanks to social media.

80
00:05:09,100 --> 00:05:11,019
WITH CHOYO. LOOK AT THE HOTTIE
IN THE BACKGROUND.

81
00:05:11,102 --> 00:05:12,603
[Anzu] What?

82
00:05:16,816 --> 00:05:18,234
[Tsukasa gasps]

83
00:05:18,318 --> 00:05:19,527
[thuds]

84
00:05:20,403 --> 00:05:21,529
[Yukana gasps]

85
00:05:22,363 --> 00:05:24,949
How come… you're…

86
00:05:26,117 --> 00:05:28,411
[Yukana] Tsukasa!

87
00:05:32,123 --> 00:05:34,500
[Anzu] Whoa, this is bad.

88
00:05:35,877 --> 00:05:37,503
[Tsukasa gasps anxiously]

89
00:05:43,009 --> 00:05:44,927
I'm sorry, but he's busy.

90
00:05:45,970 --> 00:05:47,930
So please, time for you to leave.

91
00:05:48,014 --> 00:05:50,016
[pensive music]

92
00:05:56,773 --> 00:05:58,232
[exhales deeply]

93
00:06:00,526 --> 00:06:02,737
[breathing heavily]

94
00:06:04,530 --> 00:06:07,033
[Anzu] Man,
Kazuki's really sweating over there.

95
00:06:08,242 --> 00:06:09,077
Hmm.

96
00:06:19,003 --> 00:06:20,296
[sighs in relief]

97
00:06:21,839 --> 00:06:23,466
[Anzu] She's gone now, Kazuki.

98
00:06:24,675 --> 00:06:27,512
[Tsukasa] How did she,
how did she approach you?

99
00:06:28,012 --> 00:06:31,349
Well, she called out my name
when I was walking home.

100
00:06:34,018 --> 00:06:37,021
[Anzu] Then she told me
that she was your girlfriend.

101
00:06:37,105 --> 00:06:37,939
[retches]

102
00:06:38,981 --> 00:06:40,066
[Anzu] Kazuki!

103
00:06:41,150 --> 00:06:43,111
-[retching]
-[Anzu gasps]

104
00:06:43,194 --> 00:06:45,655
[Tsukasa in hoarse voice]
And, did you, did you believe her?

105
00:06:45,738 --> 00:06:46,572
Mm-mm.

106
00:06:47,698 --> 00:06:50,076
-No, I didn't. Something felt off.
-[Tsukasa grunts]

107
00:06:50,993 --> 00:06:52,078
[exhales sharply]

108
00:06:53,287 --> 00:06:55,998
[groans weakly]

109
00:06:56,999 --> 00:06:58,167
She's, uh…

110
00:06:59,252 --> 00:07:00,461
[Tsukasa] She's my stalker.

111
00:07:00,962 --> 00:07:01,963
What?

112
00:07:02,672 --> 00:07:05,591
[eerie music]

113
00:07:10,638 --> 00:07:13,099
[Tsukasa] I'm starting
to feel a lot better now.

114
00:07:13,599 --> 00:07:15,935
[Anzu] I'll get you
something to drink. Uh?

115
00:07:19,063 --> 00:07:20,690
Stay with me a little longer.

116
00:07:22,442 --> 00:07:25,653
[Anzu] Jeez, his hands are super cold.

117
00:07:27,238 --> 00:07:28,239
Sorry.

118
00:07:28,322 --> 00:07:29,449
[Anzu] It's okay.

119
00:07:29,532 --> 00:07:33,119
I'm really sorry too.
I shouldn't have even talked to her.

120
00:07:34,162 --> 00:07:35,580
It's not your fault.

121
00:07:36,205 --> 00:07:39,083
Knowing how she is,
she already had your address.

122
00:07:40,084 --> 00:07:41,127
[Tsukasa] Anyway.

123
00:07:44,297 --> 00:07:46,466
You knew. You could sense it.

124
00:07:46,966 --> 00:07:48,426
[sighs softly]

125
00:07:50,178 --> 00:07:53,806
Well, I did say I would tell you
why I was living alone.

126
00:07:55,266 --> 00:07:57,351
You shouldn't feel pressured
to talk about it.

127
00:08:01,439 --> 00:08:03,900
I want to, Hoshino.

128
00:08:03,983 --> 00:08:05,151
[gasps]

129
00:08:05,234 --> 00:08:06,611
[Tsukasa] Here's how it happened.

130
00:08:06,694 --> 00:08:07,737
[Yukana grunts]

131
00:08:07,820 --> 00:08:09,822
-You know that book I wanted?
-Oh yeah.

132
00:08:09,906 --> 00:08:11,699
-Well, dude, I really--
-Huh?

133
00:08:11,782 --> 00:08:13,409
[hurried footsteps]

134
00:08:13,493 --> 00:08:14,577
[Tsukasa] Are you okay?

135
00:08:16,662 --> 00:08:17,914
Here.

136
00:08:22,293 --> 00:08:24,545
[gasps]

137
00:08:24,629 --> 00:08:25,963
[Yukana] Thank you very much.

138
00:08:26,464 --> 00:08:28,674
[Tsukasa] All I did was give her the bag.

139
00:08:28,758 --> 00:08:30,676
[rain pattering]

140
00:08:30,760 --> 00:08:33,179
-Hey, remember that book?
-Yeah, did you get it?

141
00:08:33,262 --> 00:08:34,764
-[boy 1] I did, man, for nearly after…
-Morning.

142
00:08:34,847 --> 00:08:36,182
Oh. Good morning.

143
00:08:39,143 --> 00:08:40,186
Morning.

144
00:08:41,145 --> 00:08:42,188
Morning.

145
00:08:43,523 --> 00:08:44,774
[gasps]

146
00:08:44,857 --> 00:08:46,317
[Tsukasa in weak voice]
Hello.

147
00:08:47,777 --> 00:08:50,154
That chick's here for you,
like, every day.

148
00:08:50,238 --> 00:08:51,072
Mm-hm.

149
00:08:51,155 --> 00:08:53,282
Hey, she must like you a lot, my dude.

150
00:08:54,492 --> 00:08:56,160
[Tsukasa] Nah,
I'm sure it's not like that.

151
00:08:56,244 --> 00:08:58,621
[boy 1] Man, it must be nice
to be so good-looking.

152
00:08:59,205 --> 00:09:00,581
[doorbell dings]

153
00:09:00,665 --> 00:09:01,707
[delivery man] Delivery.

154
00:09:01,791 --> 00:09:02,833
TO: TSUKASA KAZUKI

155
00:09:02,917 --> 00:09:03,960
For me?

156
00:09:04,043 --> 00:09:06,045
[foreboding music]

157
00:09:08,422 --> 00:09:09,257
Hmm.

158
00:09:11,759 --> 00:09:12,593
Hmm?

159
00:09:17,181 --> 00:09:18,975
And it totally freaked me out.

160
00:09:19,058 --> 00:09:21,602
-That makes sense.
-Hey, Mom, about this shirt…

161
00:09:21,686 --> 00:09:23,479
Oh, is that a new one?

162
00:09:23,563 --> 00:09:25,064
Did Arisa get it for you?

163
00:09:25,147 --> 00:09:27,108
What? No, I didn't get it for him.

164
00:09:27,692 --> 00:09:29,860
Huh?
[sighs]

165
00:09:29,944 --> 00:09:31,821
[boy 2] No, dude,
it was just like I thought.

166
00:09:31,904 --> 00:09:32,863
[boy 1] He's confiscating everything.

167
00:09:32,947 --> 00:09:34,448
-So your brother had…
-Oh, really? That's crazy.

168
00:09:34,532 --> 00:09:35,366
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

169
00:09:35,449 --> 00:09:37,618
That dude would take
all my stuff without asking.

170
00:09:37,702 --> 00:09:38,869
[Yukana] Morning.

171
00:09:39,453 --> 00:09:42,373
-That shirt looks so good on you.
-[Tsukasa gasps]

172
00:09:43,332 --> 00:09:44,333
What?

173
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:47,003
[doorbell dings]

174
00:09:48,546 --> 00:09:51,257
[breathes heavily]

175
00:09:51,340 --> 00:09:56,429
[doorbell dinging]

176
00:09:56,971 --> 00:10:00,016
[cutlery clinking]

177
00:10:00,600 --> 00:10:02,018
[Tsukasa's mom] So disturbing.

178
00:10:02,101 --> 00:10:04,687
Someone created multiple accounts
for different websites

179
00:10:04,770 --> 00:10:06,522
using my name without my permission.

180
00:10:06,606 --> 00:10:09,025
Thank goodness
the purchases weren't billed to you.

181
00:10:09,108 --> 00:10:10,776
But this is still serious.

182
00:10:10,860 --> 00:10:12,528
I think we should speak to the police.

183
00:10:13,321 --> 00:10:16,032
[Tsukasa's dad] There's no reason
to involve the police. Shame on you!

184
00:10:16,907 --> 00:10:17,950
Tsukasa.

185
00:10:18,034 --> 00:10:21,037
You're making these purchases
using your mom's name, aren't you?

186
00:10:21,120 --> 00:10:22,288
-No--
-Do you really think

187
00:10:22,371 --> 00:10:24,040
Tsukasa would ever do that?

188
00:10:24,123 --> 00:10:26,417
-Don't talk to your father that way.
-Huh…

189
00:10:26,500 --> 00:10:27,543
[Arisa sighs]

190
00:10:27,627 --> 00:10:31,422
[Tsukasa's mom] Anyway, let's just
return the packages unopened for now.

191
00:10:34,634 --> 00:10:37,428
[Yukana] Tsukasa,
you like the gifts I send?

192
00:10:38,638 --> 00:10:41,432
[Tsukasa] I knew it. You sent everything.

193
00:10:42,224 --> 00:10:43,559
Hmm.

194
00:10:43,643 --> 00:10:45,311
[Tsukasa] Why are you doing this?

195
00:10:45,978 --> 00:10:48,773
Oh. I'm sorry,
I didn't mean to bother you.

196
00:10:49,357 --> 00:10:51,817
I should have asked
what kind of clothes you like first.

197
00:10:52,485 --> 00:10:54,153
[Tsukasa] No, that's not what I mean.

198
00:10:54,236 --> 00:10:56,322
You made a bunch of accounts
using my mom's name.

199
00:10:56,405 --> 00:11:00,451
Well I, I haven't really met
your family yet, so,

200
00:11:00,534 --> 00:11:02,703
are you worried about what they may think?

201
00:11:03,746 --> 00:11:05,414
Embarrassed if they found out about us?

202
00:11:06,415 --> 00:11:07,833
[Tsukasa] What are you…
[gasps]

203
00:11:07,917 --> 00:11:09,335
So…

204
00:11:10,419 --> 00:11:11,796
What clothes do you like, then?

205
00:11:12,922 --> 00:11:14,840
[Yukana] Just tell me, Tsukasa.

206
00:11:15,758 --> 00:11:18,677
[scared gasps, breathing nervously]

207
00:11:23,432 --> 00:11:25,851
Please, just don't send me anything else

208
00:11:25,935 --> 00:11:28,020
ever again. Just leave me alone.

209
00:11:28,104 --> 00:11:30,106
[melancholy music]

210
00:11:34,610 --> 00:11:36,153
-[boy 2] Hey, so check it out.
-What's up?

211
00:11:36,237 --> 00:11:37,530
Remember what my big brother did?

212
00:11:37,613 --> 00:11:39,698
-No.
-[boy 2] Well, I ratted him out to my mom.

213
00:11:39,782 --> 00:11:40,866
-[boy 2 laughs]
-[boy 1] It's pretty crazy, right?

214
00:11:40,950 --> 00:11:42,118
[boy 2] No way, dude.

215
00:11:42,868 --> 00:11:45,830
Hey, isn't that the girl who waits
for you, like, every single morning?

216
00:11:46,580 --> 00:11:48,124
What? Uh, I don't know.

217
00:11:48,207 --> 00:11:49,542
-Hmm?
-Hmm.

218
00:11:49,625 --> 00:11:51,544
[rain pattering]

219
00:11:55,631 --> 00:11:57,550
[breathing nervously]

220
00:11:57,633 --> 00:11:59,885
[boy 2] See you later, dude.
Have fun tonight.

221
00:12:00,553 --> 00:12:02,680
-[student 1] Yay!
-[student 2] We have a test tomorrow.

222
00:12:02,763 --> 00:12:04,056
[scared gasp]

223
00:12:04,140 --> 00:12:06,559
[eerie music]

224
00:12:06,642 --> 00:12:07,685
[Tsukasa gasps]

225
00:12:19,864 --> 00:12:22,283
[moaning]

226
00:12:22,366 --> 00:12:24,785
[suspenseful music]

227
00:12:24,869 --> 00:12:26,871
[grunting]

228
00:12:32,751 --> 00:12:35,588
[Yukana] Oh, Tsukasa,
you're so shy, aren't you?

229
00:12:36,797 --> 00:12:40,176
I understand that you don't want anyone
close to you to know about us.

230
00:12:41,886 --> 00:12:44,430
Since I still get to see you every day,

231
00:12:44,513 --> 00:12:47,266
I can suffer
through us not being able to speak.

232
00:12:48,476 --> 00:12:50,269
My sweet Tsukasa.

233
00:12:51,228 --> 00:12:52,396
Seems everyone else…

234
00:12:53,481 --> 00:12:54,523
is in the way.

235
00:12:54,607 --> 00:12:56,025
GIRLS MY AGE ARE ANNOYING AND CREEPY

236
00:12:56,108 --> 00:12:57,526
ALL GUYS ARE IMMATURE.
I WISH THEY LEFT ME ALONE.

237
00:12:57,610 --> 00:13:00,654
[boy 2] Isn't that the chick who's always
waiting for you on our way to school?

238
00:13:00,738 --> 00:13:03,115
[girl 1] Excuse me,
you're dating older women now?

239
00:13:03,199 --> 00:13:04,200
SECOND ACCOUNT OF A STUDENT.
MAINLY COMPLAINTS.

240
00:13:04,283 --> 00:13:06,285
[boy 3] Dude, how are you
gonna talk trash about us online?

241
00:13:06,368 --> 00:13:08,078
[girl 2] She's obviously
trying to get with me.

242
00:13:08,162 --> 00:13:09,413
He can't just diss me like that.

243
00:13:09,497 --> 00:13:10,748
[boy 4] What the hell is that post, dude?

244
00:13:10,831 --> 00:13:12,541
[girl 3] Tsukasa, you're legit the worst.

245
00:13:12,625 --> 00:13:14,710
[boy 2] I can't believe
you're so two-faced, man!

246
00:13:15,961 --> 00:13:17,963
-[smacks]
-[Tsukasa's mom and Arisa gasp]

247
00:13:18,047 --> 00:13:19,006
[Arisa] Hey!

248
00:13:19,798 --> 00:13:21,675
[Tsukasa's dad]
You have some woman following you

249
00:13:21,759 --> 00:13:23,344
who put a wire and a camera on you?

250
00:13:23,427 --> 00:13:24,678
Disgraceful!

251
00:13:24,762 --> 00:13:26,388
It's not Tsukasa's fault, Dad!

252
00:13:26,472 --> 00:13:28,182
He is the victim here.

253
00:13:28,265 --> 00:13:30,351
[Tsukasa's dad] This happened
because you lead her on.

254
00:13:30,434 --> 00:13:31,977
You're not sincere with people.

255
00:13:37,566 --> 00:13:39,193
-[Yukana] Tsukasa.
-[gasps]

256
00:13:40,069 --> 00:13:41,195
This is awful.

257
00:13:41,278 --> 00:13:42,112
[breathing nervously]

258
00:13:42,196 --> 00:13:44,990
All everyone wants to do was
pull us apart.

259
00:13:45,741 --> 00:13:48,285
And we're so deeply in love
with each other--

260
00:13:48,369 --> 00:13:49,703
-[slams]
-[Tsukasa gasps]

261
00:13:49,787 --> 00:13:50,996
-[Arisa pants]
-[Yukana groans]

262
00:13:51,080 --> 00:13:53,999
Go away!
We have a restraining order against you!

263
00:13:54,083 --> 00:13:57,002
So unless you wanna spend
the rest of your life in jail,

264
00:13:57,628 --> 00:13:59,630
don't come near my brother ever again!

265
00:13:59,713 --> 00:14:01,006
[Yukana shudders]

266
00:14:02,299 --> 00:14:03,551
[Tsukasa] I'm off to school.

267
00:14:04,677 --> 00:14:05,511
[Tsukasa sighs]

268
00:14:06,428 --> 00:14:07,513
[breathing nervously]

269
00:14:08,639 --> 00:14:11,392
[twisted chuckle]

270
00:14:12,309 --> 00:14:14,520
[laughing]

271
00:14:14,603 --> 00:14:17,523
[distorted chatter]

272
00:14:19,275 --> 00:14:20,192
[Tsukasa grunts]

273
00:14:20,734 --> 00:14:23,529
[sobbing]

274
00:14:24,989 --> 00:14:27,533
[sighs]
Tsukasa.

275
00:14:29,493 --> 00:14:30,703
[Tsukasa] And after all that,

276
00:14:31,412 --> 00:14:32,997
I couldn't even go to school.

277
00:14:34,915 --> 00:14:37,459
[Tsukasa] If only I hadn't stopped
to pick up her bag.

278
00:14:38,085 --> 00:14:41,547
And if… I regretted that moment
again and again in my head,

279
00:14:41,630 --> 00:14:42,548
I still do.

280
00:14:44,633 --> 00:14:48,470
My homeroom teacher,
my mom, and Arisa helped me.

281
00:14:49,138 --> 00:14:50,389
And I moved away.

282
00:14:50,973 --> 00:14:54,018
And started living alone
so no one could find my address.

283
00:14:55,561 --> 00:14:58,522
I got to a place
where I could live a normal life,

284
00:14:59,440 --> 00:15:02,818
but I still feel sick when people stare,
and when girls approach me.

285
00:15:04,445 --> 00:15:07,907
I'm just a spineless loser
so all I can do is be cold,

286
00:15:07,990 --> 00:15:10,075
and put up walls to protect myself.

287
00:15:11,201 --> 00:15:15,998
Even when my dad came at me,
I was too weak to defend myself.

288
00:15:17,499 --> 00:15:18,667
All of it happened

289
00:15:19,335 --> 00:15:22,463
because I don't make genuine relationships
and let people in.

290
00:15:23,047 --> 00:15:25,674
None of my classmates believed
a word that I said,

291
00:15:26,342 --> 00:15:28,052
and all of it is my fault.

292
00:15:28,552 --> 00:15:30,304
[sobs]

293
00:15:31,388 --> 00:15:34,475
Kazuki, stop me if you hate it.

294
00:15:35,059 --> 00:15:36,977
-[Anzu] 'Cause I'm gonna hug you now.
-[gasps]

295
00:15:38,145 --> 00:15:39,438
[surprised gasp]

296
00:15:39,521 --> 00:15:41,815
[melancholy music]

297
00:15:41,899 --> 00:15:44,068
None of this is any of your fault.

298
00:15:45,069 --> 00:15:46,946
-I'm so mad.
-[Tsukasa gasps]

299
00:15:47,029 --> 00:15:48,989
[Anzu] If only
we had become friends sooner.

300
00:15:49,782 --> 00:15:53,077
I would have believed you,
even when nobody else did.

301
00:15:56,038 --> 00:15:57,122
[sobs]

302
00:15:57,623 --> 00:16:01,335
I feel the same way.
I wish I had met you sooner too.

303
00:16:05,130 --> 00:16:07,049
[Arisa] I went ahead
and contacted the police.

304
00:16:08,050 --> 00:16:10,052
We're gonna have to be guarded
for a while.

305
00:16:10,552 --> 00:16:12,638
I'm sorry you're dealing with this.

306
00:16:13,639 --> 00:16:14,932
[Tsukasa] It's because I'm weak.

307
00:16:15,557 --> 00:16:16,850
It's so embarrassing.

308
00:16:18,143 --> 00:16:19,645
[Anzu] Hey, that's not true.

309
00:16:21,355 --> 00:16:23,899
Don't worry. I'm right here.

310
00:16:23,983 --> 00:16:25,985
[soft guitar music]

311
00:16:26,068 --> 00:16:27,236
[Arisa sighs]

312
00:16:27,319 --> 00:16:29,571
[Arisa] Social media
can be really problematic.

313
00:16:29,655 --> 00:16:32,116
I can't believe how fast she found you.

314
00:16:32,199 --> 00:16:33,075
Hmm.

315
00:16:34,827 --> 00:16:38,080
Well, I'll stay over on the days
that I don't have to work.

316
00:16:38,163 --> 00:16:40,040
You don't have to do that.

317
00:16:41,625 --> 00:16:43,377
I'm sure you're busy as well.

318
00:16:46,338 --> 00:16:48,173
[sighs]
Listen.

319
00:16:49,508 --> 00:16:52,594
I know you're mature for your age,
but you're still just a kid.

320
00:16:53,679 --> 00:16:56,598
[Arisa] So, let people help you
when you need it.

321
00:16:58,183 --> 00:16:59,101
[slams]

322
00:16:59,184 --> 00:17:01,103
[Yukana's mom]
Would you let it go with this kid?

323
00:17:02,604 --> 00:17:06,150
[frustrated sigh]
You're causing too much trouble now.

324
00:17:06,233 --> 00:17:10,529
We can't just keep running
to your uncle every time you do this.

325
00:17:10,612 --> 00:17:13,824
Jeez, I don't believe any of this
would have happened

326
00:17:13,907 --> 00:17:16,035
if this damn guy didn't lead you on…

327
00:17:16,118 --> 00:17:18,162
Don't say that about Tsukasa!

328
00:17:20,080 --> 00:17:22,332
[Yukana] When I was getting bullied
at work every day,

329
00:17:23,584 --> 00:17:26,128
Tsukasa was such a sweetheart to me.

330
00:17:27,463 --> 00:17:29,381
Every day, he would come visit.

331
00:17:30,466 --> 00:17:33,677
And we talked about,
well, anything all day.

332
00:17:35,137 --> 00:17:36,472
[Yukana's mom exhales heavily]

333
00:17:36,555 --> 00:17:38,682
[Yukana's mom]
How could he do this to you?

334
00:17:38,766 --> 00:17:40,768
I wanna take him to court.

335
00:17:41,977 --> 00:17:42,811
[door opens]

336
00:17:42,895 --> 00:17:45,064
[Yukana] We were only
seeing each other, nothing more.

337
00:17:45,147 --> 00:17:46,023
[Yukana sobs]

338
00:17:46,106 --> 00:17:48,400
It's not anybody else's business but ours.

339
00:17:48,984 --> 00:17:53,489
And now yet another girl
is getting too close to my Tsukasa!

340
00:17:54,531 --> 00:17:56,742
[exhales sharply]

341
00:18:01,163 --> 00:18:02,498
She's in the way.

342
00:18:04,291 --> 00:18:07,419
[manager] Ah, Hoshino,
you can go after you finish cleaning that.

343
00:18:08,170 --> 00:18:09,004
Okay.

344
00:18:12,216 --> 00:18:15,511
What's up? You don't normally look upset.

345
00:18:16,011 --> 00:18:17,429
Huh? Um…

346
00:18:18,305 --> 00:18:19,515
Uh…

347
00:18:20,265 --> 00:18:21,433
Yeah…

348
00:18:22,726 --> 00:18:24,520
[Hijiri] We don't have
any customers right now,

349
00:18:24,603 --> 00:18:26,438
so I'm happy to lend you an ear.

350
00:18:27,689 --> 00:18:31,902
But don't get excited, I'm not worried
about you or anything silly like that.

351
00:18:31,985 --> 00:18:34,446
Will you chill out
with the hot and cold, Hijiri?

352
00:18:36,448 --> 00:18:38,951
[Anzu] He texted a few times yesterday
to check on me.

353
00:18:39,785 --> 00:18:42,412
In his own way, he's making sure I'm okay.

354
00:18:42,496 --> 00:18:43,956
ARE YOU OKAY?
IF YOU ARE OKAY, IT'S FINE

355
00:18:45,082 --> 00:18:48,168
[Anzu] I was just thinking about
what I might be able to do

356
00:18:48,252 --> 00:18:50,379
to, uh, help out a friend of mine.

357
00:18:50,462 --> 00:18:52,464
[soft piano music]

358
00:18:54,216 --> 00:18:56,093
[Hijiri] Well,
as long as you're near them,

359
00:18:56,176 --> 00:18:57,845
I'm sure everything will be all right.

360
00:18:59,138 --> 00:19:00,097
Huh?

361
00:19:03,100 --> 00:19:07,146
Wait, what?
So that's what you think about me, huh?

362
00:19:07,229 --> 00:19:08,355
Please don't touch me.

363
00:19:12,860 --> 00:19:15,863
Aw, shoot. Hoshino already left, huh?

364
00:19:16,363 --> 00:19:18,323
[manager] Well, she forgot her phone here.

365
00:19:19,950 --> 00:19:22,911
If we run, we can catch her.
I'll just send Tsuchiya.

366
00:19:22,995 --> 00:19:24,746
-[snaps fingers]
-How can I help, sir?

367
00:19:24,830 --> 00:19:26,748
[manager]
I've been wondering all this time,

368
00:19:26,832 --> 00:19:29,042
what country are you the prince of,
Mr. Koganei?

369
00:19:29,710 --> 00:19:32,796
[Saki] Hi there. Is Anzu in the back?

370
00:19:33,463 --> 00:19:34,756
-No, she just left.
-[door closes]

371
00:19:35,382 --> 00:19:39,386
What? She sent a text asking me
to come pick her up with my brother.

372
00:19:40,345 --> 00:19:41,763
-[Saki's brother grunts]
-[Saki] Uh…

373
00:19:43,140 --> 00:19:48,937
Oh, shoot! Did I forget my phone?
[groans in frustration]

374
00:19:49,021 --> 00:19:51,315
What a drag. Oh?

375
00:19:51,398 --> 00:19:53,400
[suspenseful music]

376
00:19:53,901 --> 00:19:54,902
Hey.

377
00:19:55,402 --> 00:19:57,446
[nervous gasp]

378
00:19:58,405 --> 00:20:00,741
[punk 1] We're gonna need you
to come over here with us.

379
00:20:00,824 --> 00:20:03,118
[Anzu] Huh? What? Who are you?

380
00:20:03,202 --> 00:20:04,328
[punk 1] I'm sorry, girl,

381
00:20:04,411 --> 00:20:07,956
but we were told to make sure
you can't be out in public.

382
00:20:08,040 --> 00:20:10,751
-[Anzu groaning]
-[thuds]

383
00:20:13,337 --> 00:20:14,880
[yelps]

384
00:20:15,422 --> 00:20:16,256
[punk 1] Huh?

385
00:20:16,340 --> 00:20:17,507
-[bone cracks]
-Huh?

386
00:20:17,591 --> 00:20:18,759
[grunts]

387
00:20:20,219 --> 00:20:23,263
What are you doing? Get away from Anzu.

388
00:20:24,014 --> 00:20:25,015
Uh, Junta…

389
00:20:25,098 --> 00:20:26,767
-Damn it…
-[punk 1 groans]

390
00:20:27,351 --> 00:20:29,228
Who the hell is this brat?

391
00:20:30,020 --> 00:20:31,188
[punk 2 grunts, groans]

392
00:20:33,023 --> 00:20:33,941
-[thuds]
-[Anzu gasps]

393
00:20:34,858 --> 00:20:35,859
Ryuya!

394
00:20:35,943 --> 00:20:37,861
-[groans]
-Tonta, stay out of it!

395
00:20:37,945 --> 00:20:39,947
-You can get kicked off the team!
-[grunting]

396
00:20:40,989 --> 00:20:42,407
[Anzu gasping]

397
00:20:43,367 --> 00:20:45,369
[punks groaning]

398
00:20:46,620 --> 00:20:48,622
Hey, back off!

399
00:20:49,706 --> 00:20:50,707
[surprised gasps]

400
00:20:50,791 --> 00:20:53,460
Pardon, I'm not sure what's going on here,

401
00:20:53,543 --> 00:20:55,504
but I'm afraid I'll have to stop you.

402
00:20:55,587 --> 00:20:57,256
-[groans]
-[bones crack]

403
00:20:58,840 --> 00:21:00,133
Mr. Tsuchiya!

404
00:21:00,217 --> 00:21:03,804
Miss Hoshino, my sincerest apologies.
I'm sorry to intrude.

405
00:21:04,388 --> 00:21:06,515
But I'm here to deliver
something you forgot.

406
00:21:07,140 --> 00:21:08,350
-[grunts]
-[gasps]

407
00:21:08,976 --> 00:21:10,352
[groans]

408
00:21:10,435 --> 00:21:11,812
The hell, man?

409
00:21:13,605 --> 00:21:14,648
[Ryuya clears throat]

410
00:21:17,150 --> 00:21:19,987
Hold up, you guys. Naoki, is that you?

411
00:21:20,070 --> 00:21:22,072
[gasps]
Mr. Takamine!

412
00:21:22,739 --> 00:21:24,866
Wanna tell me what the hell you're doing?

413
00:21:24,950 --> 00:21:26,576
I'm so sorry.

414
00:21:27,327 --> 00:21:30,872
[Naoki] We had no choice.
This crazy chick threatens us.

415
00:21:31,665 --> 00:21:33,667
[foreboding music]

416
00:21:37,170 --> 00:21:38,630
Was she around 20?

417
00:21:38,714 --> 00:21:41,133
Did she have really dark hair,
to about here?

418
00:21:41,216 --> 00:21:42,634
Yeah, that's right.

419
00:21:42,718 --> 00:21:43,885
[gasps]

420
00:21:43,969 --> 00:21:46,888
[Saki's brother] You two ain't getting off
easy for this, you hear?

421
00:21:47,472 --> 00:21:48,849
Right, Shades-y?

422
00:21:49,349 --> 00:21:50,726
I'm sorry. Shades-y, you said?

423
00:21:51,310 --> 00:21:53,478
Oh, brother,
was that supposed to be clever?

424
00:21:53,562 --> 00:21:54,479
Um…

425
00:21:54,980 --> 00:21:56,732
[insects chirruping]

426
00:21:57,774 --> 00:21:59,901
[Anzu] I'm okay, thanks to you guys.

427
00:22:00,694 --> 00:22:03,822
I just can't believe everyone showed up
with such great timing.

428
00:22:03,905 --> 00:22:07,409
[Ryuya] Well, I mean, I did get
that super random text from you.

429
00:22:07,492 --> 00:22:09,077
What? A text?

430
00:22:09,161 --> 00:22:11,747
[Saki] Yeah, and you messaged me
to bring my brother,

431
00:22:11,830 --> 00:22:13,915
-so I didn't know what to expect.
-Hmm?

432
00:22:13,999 --> 00:22:14,916
WANT TO GO TO THE ARCADE AFTER?

433
00:22:15,000 --> 00:22:16,293
[Anzu] Wait.

434
00:22:16,376 --> 00:22:17,210
WHEN DO YOU GET OFF?

435
00:22:17,294 --> 00:22:18,920
I don't remember sending any of these.

436
00:22:19,504 --> 00:22:21,048
I don't think you're safe here.

437
00:22:21,131 --> 00:22:23,508
You should really hurry home
and try to get some rest.

438
00:22:23,592 --> 00:22:26,428
Oh? Yeah, I'll go do that.

439
00:22:27,554 --> 00:22:29,848
Thank you all so much, seriously.

440
00:22:31,016 --> 00:22:33,435
[Arisa] What? I honestly can't believe it.

441
00:22:33,518 --> 00:22:36,438
[Anzu] I know, but thankfully
nothing serious happened.

442
00:22:37,022 --> 00:22:38,732
I should leave. I mean,

443
00:22:39,566 --> 00:22:41,943
after all that, I can't stay here.

444
00:22:42,611 --> 00:22:43,487
[sighs]

445
00:22:46,364 --> 00:22:47,699
-[Anzu] I won't let you.
-[gasps]

446
00:22:48,283 --> 00:22:49,868
-[Anzu] You shouldn't have to suffer…
-Mm.

447
00:22:49,951 --> 00:22:51,787
…just because someone like her is
out there.

448
00:22:52,287 --> 00:22:54,289
Let's figure this out as a team.

449
00:22:56,416 --> 00:22:57,542
[exhales deeply]

450
00:22:58,543 --> 00:22:59,461
[Tsukasa] Thanks.

451
00:23:03,465 --> 00:23:05,467
Bad moods are a big no-no!

452
00:23:05,550 --> 00:23:09,387
This cute boy right here will help you
get into a good one!

453
00:23:10,097 --> 00:23:12,641
Kick rocks. You embody my negativity.

454
00:23:13,308 --> 00:23:16,144
Oh wow, you're hard.
[humming happily]

455
00:23:16,728 --> 00:23:19,231
[Rio] You know, I got you out
of that sticky situation

456
00:23:19,314 --> 00:23:21,316
by sending those texts to everyone
with your phone.

457
00:23:21,399 --> 00:23:23,819
What, it was you? You send the texts?

458
00:23:23,902 --> 00:23:24,986
[Rio] Yes, ma'am.

459
00:23:25,487 --> 00:23:27,197
I set the whole thing up,

460
00:23:27,280 --> 00:23:30,367
so that all of the pawns
would come running to protect you.

461
00:23:30,450 --> 00:23:31,910
Don't you dare call them "pawns"!

462
00:23:32,994 --> 00:23:34,162
[sighs]

463
00:23:35,205 --> 00:23:38,166
Anyway, thank you.
You really saved my life.

464
00:23:38,250 --> 00:23:39,918
First time I'm grateful for you.

465
00:23:40,001 --> 00:23:41,670
An ant's booger's worth.

466
00:23:41,753 --> 00:23:43,463
A microscopic level, oh!

467
00:23:44,589 --> 00:23:48,635
[Anzu] Look, if you're a wizard,
can't you do something about this stalker?

468
00:23:48,718 --> 00:23:52,013
Like, put up a barrier, maybe,
that keeps her from finding Kazuki.

469
00:23:52,931 --> 00:23:54,099
Hmm.

470
00:23:54,683 --> 00:23:56,601
I'm only able to use my magic,

471
00:23:56,685 --> 00:23:59,521
if it contributes
to your romantic relationship somehow.

472
00:24:00,355 --> 00:24:01,523
Here's the thing.

473
00:24:01,606 --> 00:24:02,691
If you do nothing about it,

474
00:24:02,774 --> 00:24:05,527
then you would be exposing me to danger,
am I right?

475
00:24:05,610 --> 00:24:06,987
Whoa…

476
00:24:07,571 --> 00:24:10,907
Well, if it's true you're going
to be exposed to future danger,

477
00:24:11,491 --> 00:24:14,661
[Rio] I'll just have to remove Kazuki
from your potential partner options.

478
00:24:15,704 --> 00:24:16,913
[groans]

479
00:24:16,997 --> 00:24:19,457
[Rio] Gotta eliminate those risky pawns,
am I right?

480
00:24:20,000 --> 00:24:21,001
[Anzu grunts]

481
00:24:23,879 --> 00:24:24,713
Heh?

482
00:24:24,796 --> 00:24:26,214
-[Anzu grunts]
-[Rio] No!

483
00:24:28,175 --> 00:24:30,969
-[squeaks]
-[yells]

484
00:24:31,970 --> 00:24:34,222
I'm done talking
to anyone without a heart.

485
00:24:34,306 --> 00:24:35,640
[Anzu] Get out.

486
00:24:35,724 --> 00:24:36,558
[door closes]

487
00:24:37,767 --> 00:24:39,060
[Rio] Aw, jeez.

488
00:24:45,275 --> 00:24:48,486
Well, now I won't be able
to use my magic again for a while.

489
00:24:50,113 --> 00:24:52,240
-[phone keyboard clicking]
-[door opens]

490
00:24:53,783 --> 00:24:55,327
I can't fall asleep.

491
00:24:56,328 --> 00:24:57,662
[Junta groans]
I'm really thirsty.

492
00:25:00,332 --> 00:25:03,668
Sorry Junta, for putting Hoshino
in all this danger.

493
00:25:04,252 --> 00:25:05,754
Why are you apologizing?

494
00:25:06,504 --> 00:25:09,007
[Junta sighs]
You shouldn't feel responsible

495
00:25:09,090 --> 00:25:10,008
for any of this stuff.

496
00:25:10,800 --> 00:25:11,760
Hmm.

497
00:25:12,594 --> 00:25:16,139
Luckily, Anzu didn't get hurt
this time around.

498
00:25:16,848 --> 00:25:18,975
But I won't let that stalker do this.

499
00:25:19,851 --> 00:25:24,105
I swear, if she threatens Anzu again,
I don't know what I'm gonna do.

500
00:25:25,774 --> 00:25:28,109
If it gets me kicked off the team,
then so be it.

501
00:25:29,736 --> 00:25:31,488
I've made up my mind now,

502
00:25:32,113 --> 00:25:35,617
and I have no regrets.
It's got nothing to do with you.

503
00:25:38,036 --> 00:25:41,498
[Junta] Truth is, the reason
I started playing baseball was…

504
00:25:42,123 --> 00:25:44,584
-What kind of guys do you like, Anzu?
-Hmm?

505
00:25:44,668 --> 00:25:46,044
Hmm…

506
00:25:46,753 --> 00:25:48,546
Someone who's super athletic!

507
00:25:48,630 --> 00:25:50,423
[fighting grunts]
And can beat the boss!

508
00:25:50,507 --> 00:25:52,050
[Junta] Those were her exact words.

509
00:25:52,133 --> 00:25:55,178
[zapping on TV]

510
00:25:55,262 --> 00:25:57,681
[Anzu] Tonta, you got
great hand-eye coordination.

511
00:25:57,764 --> 00:25:59,516
-Would rock at baseball, I bet.
-[gasps]

512
00:26:00,141 --> 00:26:03,061
[Junta] So, I picked up baseball
in middle school.

513
00:26:03,144 --> 00:26:04,938
Because of what Anzu said.

514
00:26:05,021 --> 00:26:06,564
[muffled laughter]

515
00:26:06,648 --> 00:26:08,108
Hey dude, don't laugh.

516
00:26:08,692 --> 00:26:11,528
No, I'm sorry. I'm sure she has no idea

517
00:26:11,611 --> 00:26:13,905
she was so influential, that's all.

518
00:26:19,911 --> 00:26:21,538
Totally. Oh?

519
00:26:22,330 --> 00:26:23,790
Hi.
[chuckles]

520
00:26:25,292 --> 00:26:27,252
[ominous music]

521
00:26:28,878 --> 00:26:31,381
[Hijiri] Has everything been okay
since the night we spoke?

522
00:26:31,464 --> 00:26:32,299
CONBINI MART

523
00:26:33,174 --> 00:26:34,175
Mm-hm.

524
00:26:34,259 --> 00:26:36,303
[Anzu] Haven't had anything happen since.

525
00:26:36,386 --> 00:26:39,848
[Anzu] Kazuki and his sister
are gonna walk me home after work today.

526
00:26:40,807 --> 00:26:44,769
That's good. But if you ever need
Tsuchiya, you can ask any time.

527
00:26:45,395 --> 00:26:46,604
[chuckles]

528
00:26:46,688 --> 00:26:49,399
Well, thank you.
And if the boss was here, he'd say,

529
00:26:49,482 --> 00:26:51,735
[imitates manager]
"In what country are you an oil tycoon?"

530
00:26:51,818 --> 00:26:53,695
[in normal voice]
You know he'd say that, right?

531
00:26:53,778 --> 00:26:55,155
Yeah, he asked me already.

532
00:26:55,655 --> 00:26:57,282
[Hijiri chuckles]

533
00:26:57,365 --> 00:26:59,951
[Hijiri] Anyway, not even a king
nor an emperor

534
00:27:00,035 --> 00:27:02,078
would interest you at all, right?

535
00:27:02,162 --> 00:27:04,581
Huh? Well, yeah.

536
00:27:05,373 --> 00:27:06,249
[chuckles softly]

537
00:27:08,710 --> 00:27:10,670
All right, break's over now.

538
00:27:10,754 --> 00:27:13,340
-Yeah, I'm gonna head home.
-Good night.

539
00:27:18,011 --> 00:27:19,846
-[Yukana] Miss Hoshino.
-Huh?

540
00:27:19,929 --> 00:27:21,348
[Anzu gasps]

541
00:27:21,431 --> 00:27:23,433
[eerie music]

542
00:27:25,393 --> 00:27:27,354
Excuse me. You got a minute?

543
00:27:28,355 --> 00:27:30,815
[Anzu] Kishi. Oh, shoot.

544
00:27:30,899 --> 00:27:32,859
Tsukasa and Arisa are coming to get me.

545
00:27:33,443 --> 00:27:35,570
They'll be here any sec.
I can't let them see her.

546
00:27:35,653 --> 00:27:36,696
What do you want?

547
00:27:38,114 --> 00:27:39,866
[Yukana] I have something for you.

548
00:27:40,658 --> 00:27:41,868
[Anzu gasps in fear]

549
00:27:41,951 --> 00:27:43,370
[blood splats]

550
00:27:45,413 --> 00:27:46,956
A fanfare, please!

551
00:27:47,040 --> 00:27:49,125
And a big congratulations!

552
00:27:49,209 --> 00:27:51,378
Did you fall for my little trick?

553
00:27:51,461 --> 00:27:54,547
I bet now you don't feel like
skipping the ending, right?

554
00:27:54,631 --> 00:27:58,301
In today's world, you can watch
whatever you want at your own convenience.

555
00:27:58,385 --> 00:28:01,054
But don't you think in that process
we've also lost something?

556
00:28:01,137 --> 00:28:03,431
[sighs]
Don't just let things be! Come on!

557
00:28:03,515 --> 00:28:06,101
Let's go on a super-duper happy adventure!

558
00:28:06,184 --> 00:28:08,103
So I can make sure I get paid.

559
00:28:08,186 --> 00:28:10,271
[closing theme music]

560
00:28:10,355 --> 00:28:11,272
♪ Ah, yeah! ♪

561
00:28:13,775 --> 00:28:14,734
♪ Let's go! ♪

562
00:28:17,028 --> 00:28:18,154
♪ Lo-love! ♪

563
00:28:20,490 --> 00:28:21,324
♪ Here we go! ♪
